    "rules": [
      "Render orchestrator0024a860 iterates enabled bit stages1 through0x800. Stage4 copies main camera into context+3c and renders scene; stage8 orthographic phase uses context+38; stage8 tail562f68 calls562530 to restore perspective camera+3c before additional scene/static-env rendering.",
