      "Capture eye E=*(ctx48) ifnonnull elsezero, thenE.y+=1. Target T=ctx74 saved from current model translation. Backward B=normalize(E-T). R=normalize([B.z,0,-B.x]); U=cross(B,R); storedcameraaxes=-R,-U,B,translationE. ForverticalB,storedR=(B.y,0,0),U=(0,0,-1),Bunchanged.",
      "Garage511974mode5 choosescurrent selectedgaragecarposition pointer car+18->34 intoctx48, fallback(10000,-10000,0). Latermainmodeltranslation target is a separate state input, not inferred from pointer identity.",
      "562f68 bindsEnv28 with perspective camera+3c/modelmatrixctx80; renders*(615b40+190) through25c238 mask4, then adds originalctx34 fx_static_envmap_garage inmode5. Statictexture scrolloffset derivesatan2(axisX,axisZ)*width/(2pi), wrappedifnegative; defaultctx28d0=1 uses16thtexelUV562d90.",
      "Camera100FoV is not a valid description of the earlier stage4 main-camera-copy phase; it is valid for the later perspective overlay render after562530."
    ],
